{c: Verse 1}
[C] Tere bin jeena hai [Am] aise,        Dil [D] dhadka na ho [G] jaise
Ye [C] ishq hai kya [Am] duniya ko,        [D] Hum samjhaaye [G] kaise
[Em] Ab dilon ki [Am] raahon mein,        [D] Hum kuch aisa [G] kar jayein
[C] Ik dooje se [Am] bichhde toh,        [D] Saans liye bin [G] mar jayein
[Em] O Khuda,        Bata de kya [D] lakeeron mein likha
[C] Humne to,        Humne to bas [D] ishq hai [Em] kiya
